# The thrown Hackl (D-056). `spin`: four hand-drawn quarter turns for a
# throw to the right (blade up -> right -> down -> left), re-shaded per frame
# so the light stays top-left (w glint top-left of the blade, d bottom-right).
# `stuck`: the blade buried in a wall to the right (the wall covers it past
# column 10), the handle sticking out up-left; the engine mirrors both for
# left throws. Hitbox 8x8 centred, origin = its bottom centre.
sprite = hackl_thrown
size   = 12x12
origin = 6,10
hitbox = 2,2,8,8
mirror = auto
anim   = spin  frames=4 ticks=3 loop
anim   = stuck frames=1
